  "description": "It’s lightweight, agile, it’s fast.\n\nRiding slowly is not an option. This bike is designed for speed and takes sharp turns with ease.\n\nThe fully internal cable routing not only looks good but also enhances aerodynamics, undoubtedly saving you some watts.\n\nCOMFORT & STIFFNESS\n\nAluminium efficiently transfers your power to the road without losses. With tire clearance of up to 32 mm (28\"), the KRONPRINZ offers just the right amount of added comfort without sacrificing direct handling or speed — ideal for road and fast surfaces.\n\nCLEAN DESIGN & AERODYNAMICS\n\nInternal cable routing creates a clean, uncluttered look while reducing aerodynamic drag. The result is a sleek frame with improved aerodynamics for smooth, efficient riding at high speeds.\n\nPOWER & CONTROL\n\nWhether on fast descents or at road races, the reliable disc brakes deliver maximum control. KRONPRINZ is the perfect choice for riders looking for a fast, all-road- and road-oriented frame that combines performance with confidence.\n\nEMBOSSED LOGOS\n\n8bar logos are embossed into the head tube and dropouts. Subtle, durable, and premium, the refined 3D effect underscores the minimalist character.\n\nUDH READY\n\nIt is SRAM UDH-ready, making it fully prepared for modern drivetrain systems. This ensures better compatibility, easier service, and long-term future-proofing.",
